OL,3,GNEWSADambusters raid survivor steps
OL,4,Ainto cockpit of replica Lancaster
OL,5,Abomber
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who survived the Dambusters
OL,8,Fraid during World War Two has climbed
OL,9,Finto the cockpit of a replica Lancaster
OL,10,Fbomber used in the famous mission.
OL,12,FChrista Chadwick was nine when RAF 617
OL,13,FSquadron flew over Germany's Ruhr
OL,14,FValley in an operation to breach three
OL,15,Fdams on the night of 16 and 17 May
OL,16,F1943.
OL,18,FShe recalled: "People were running
OL,19,Faround through the streets screaming,
OL,20,F'Das wasser kommt' [the water is
OL,21,Fcoming].
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
